782
00:35:39,560 --> 00:35:41,440
It's been totally chill up to this point.

783
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:42,280
Damn it.

784
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:43,720
I should have checked for traps.

785
00:35:43,720 --> 00:35:44,560
Rule for initiative.

786
00:35:44,560 --> 00:35:45,640
Why am I like this?

787
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:49,920
No, you are hit with the scent of cedar,

788
00:35:49,920 --> 00:35:53,560
oil and worked metal that fills the room.

789
00:35:53,560 --> 00:35:57,039
It reminds you a lot of the forge.

790
00:35:57,039 --> 00:35:59,880
Work benches stand in perfect rows,

791
00:35:59,880 --> 00:36:03,920
each holding neatly organized hand tools.

792
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:05,480
They're half finished projects

793
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:08,480
that rest exactly where their makers left them.

794
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:11,340
Across, there's a chalkboard and written on it.

795
00:36:11,340 --> 00:36:14,400
It says, repair what can be repaired.

796
00:36:15,579 --> 00:36:19,760
Replace only what must be replaced.

797
00:36:19,760 --> 00:36:23,360
Leave every craft stronger than you found it.

